        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"aea78ca6-aaf5-4409-91cd-689d9440516a\",\"review_text\":\"Marvelous, wonderful\"},{\"review_id\":\"2ad80f64-a9fd-459e-967d-a6298e230851\",\"review_text\":\"I can't play liked songs...the app is crashing. It's been 3 days I'm tired\"},{\"review_id\":\"389d87d3-2553-4035-b362-415d16532473\",\"review_text\":\"Extra ordinary...spiritually reviving!\"},{\"review_id\":\"2e01526e-ed30-4105-9524-08c074529fea\",\"review_text\":\"the app is Good , but Not fare for the people who cant afford the premium... Just making life more terrible by providing ads ... Every 1 song and thereby 2 ads arrives ..... It's a mood spoiler...as well...\"},{\"review_id\":\"f458a67f-e7b7-4ead-a2de-9766ea57ad19\",\"review_text\":\"Also queue requires premium, very 👎 bad\"},{\"review_id\":\"48f4f4e5-91fd-4511-9d8e-99e0b484cedf\",\"review_text\":\"Dacă eu dau să ascult un Single? De ce puii mei îmi redați altă melodie?\"},{\"review_id\":\"cedb4b2b-f33c-43f6-8917-2736b9081a4c\",\"review_text\":\"Damn app is constantly turning itself on and at times even starts playing. There is no way that I have found to prevent this from happening. Getting damn close to cancelling my subscription and deleting the app.\"},{\"review_id\":\"bc03b154-9abb-4709-af87-c34524cb837c\",\"review_text\":\"Elti,agbaje\"},{\"review_id\":\"dd7ad793-cb90-4b47-9bfa-95d1ed6b0d3e\",\"review_text\":\"terrible terrible update. can't expect to put everything behind a paywall. unreasonable and unacceptable.\"},{\"review_id\":\"ae63bf7e-cf07-46fd-94d7-91916072d41e\",\"review_text\":\"Bad experience very very bad experience This application is not good Please uninstall\"}]}"
